r</span>: I used to have a roommate who was Indian. She and her family would eat meals with their fingers. That seems much easier.", "id": 2, "time": "16700", "image": "engenn6le03ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: The Greeks also have elaborate wedding parties with a lot of food and dancing.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Imagine if an Indian married a Greek.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I would try to get invited to that wedding.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: We've got to have ice cream still.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: There is always space for a little ice cream.", "id": 3, "time": "39000", "image": "engenn6le03ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le03ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le03ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}